  "question": {
    "text": "A flask containing air (open to the atmosphere) is heated from 300K to 500K. Then % of air escaped to the atmosphere is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "40",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />So <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> (P of V are constant)<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> ,<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mn>500</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />No. of moles escaped <math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />% escaped <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math>",
